                <head><hi rendition="#small-caps">Editor’s Note</hi></head>
                <p>—In a letter to Byrnes dated July 20 (<ref
                        target="#d734">document No. 734</ref>, <hi rendition="#italic">post</hi>)
                        Gromyko referred to “our conversation
                    this morning”, at which the question of trusteeship was discussed. No minutes of
                    this conversation have been found.</p>
            </div>
